msgid ""
". I put it on hold for 6 years, waiting for the right moment to use it. I "
"thought it would take 3 years to deprecate a 77 billion dollars company just "
"because open source is so cool. Sometimes it's better for your self-"
"motivation not to face reality..."
msgstr ""
"Za 6 let sem ga pustil na čakanju in čakal na pravi trenutek, da ga "
"uporabim. Mislil sem, da bo trajalo 3 leta, da se opusti podjetje v "
"vrednosti 77 milijard dolarjev, samo zato, ker je odprta koda tako kul. "
"Včasih je za vašo samomotivacijo bolje, da se ne soočite z resničnostjo..."

